doc/src/ - report sections
==========================

One file per section, \input by main.tex in this order:

    introduction.tex   problem, goals, the guiding constraint, contributions
    background.tex      CGRA design space, systolic dataflow, related work
    architecture.tex    PE datapath + the 4x4 mesh and edge injection
    protocol.tex        UART command set, a byte-level example, the control FSM
    dataflow.tex        element-wise / reduction / weight-stationary mappings
    software.tex        the layered host stack (library, model, CLI, DSL)
    analysis.tex        wire-level cost + latency model of the serial link
    results.tex         two-level verification (RTL vs. model golden reference)
    conclusion.tex      recap and future work

Each begins with \section{...}\label{sec:...}; cross-reference by label so
reordering never breaks \ref. Figures live in ../figures and are pulled in
with \input.
